you can use the function RG.MA to convert your M and A values back into normalized
R and G values.

> RG.MA
function (object) 
{
    object$R <- 2^(object$A + object$M/2)
    object$G <- 2^(object$A - object$M/2)
    object$M <- NULL
    object$A <- NULL
    new("RGList", unclass(object))
}

Marcus

